            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 21,
              "start": 21
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Stevens asked whether a district judge who denied a motion before the jury verdict can, within ten days after the verdict, change his mind and grant the motion."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kennedy",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "6397a1cfc46cf2958425596afc9b0de607b13c68e6e97fbff082b84ce6379cb0",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-6397a1cfc46c-0001-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 23,
              "start": 23
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Kennedy asked what a trial court should do if it grants judgment non obstante veredicto and, alternatively, would grant a new trial."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Scalia",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "6397a1cfc46cf2958425596afc9b0de607b13c68e6e97fbff082b84ce6379cb0",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-6397a1cfc46c-0001-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 25,
              "start": 25
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Scalia, justice Scalia questioned whether the rule implies that a reserved question is implicitly resolved when the court later does not act."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Ginsburg",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "6397a1cfc46cf2958425596afc9b0de607b13c68e6e97fbff082b84ce6379cb0",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-6397a1cfc46c-0001-0005"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 28,
              "start": 28
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Ginsburg asked whether the record before the Federal Circuit was truncated, noting that a larger record might exist."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Souter",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "6397a1cfc46cf2958425596afc9b0de607b13c68e6e97fbff082b84ce6379cb0",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-6397a1cfc46c-0003-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 53,
              "start": 53
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Souter asked for clarification on the meaning of the rule."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Scalia",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "6397a1cfc46cf2958425596afc9b0de607b13c68e6e97fbff082b84ce6379cb0",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-6397a1cfc46c-0003-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 54,
              "start": 54
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Scalia asked whether a judge can grant a new trial on a Rule 50(a) motion."
      }
    ],
